Place files here to merge them into the payload at build time.

  bin/     executables (chmod 755 applied automatically)
  lib/     shared libraries and data
  share/   architecture-independent data
  home/    files staged into the payload home directory
  etc/     configuration files

For target-specific files (e.g. a MIPS binary that should only go
into a mipsel build) use a subdirectory named after the target:

  mipsel-linux-musl-host/bin/mytool

Run "make menuconfig" > Payload Options > User overlay to enable,
or set GRIT_USER_OVERLAY_ENABLE=yes GRIT_USER_OVERLAY_ROOT=./overlay.

This file is never copied into the payload.
